cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "q2netcdf: Python tools for Rockland Scientific Q-files"
abstract: >-
  Python tools for reading, parsing, and converting Rockland Scientific
  Q-files, the binary turbulence data product generated by the ISDP data
  logger, into CF-compliant NetCDF. Supports Q-file format versions 1.2 and
  1.3, maps over 200 sensor identifier codes to named variables with CF
  metadata, and provides command-line tools for conversion, inspection,
  reduction, and merging.
